# Version

## Current Version

`0.7.4`

## Version Type

Minor model-feature release over `0.7.3`.

This version implements Phase 4 question routing at the `@office-dsl/intent-contract-model` layer: `diagnoseIntentContractDsl` now tags every generated question with `targetParties` (`Human1`, `Human2`, or `unknown`) derived from source speaker, conflicting party values, party roles, and conflict source references, and a new `questionsForParty` helper filters unresolved-field questions per party. This builds on the `0.7.3` Phase 3 diagnosis (completeness gaps, ambiguities, conflicts, unapproved assumptions, traceability gaps, and the `finalizationReady` gate).

Both the Phase 3 diagnosis and the Phase 4 routing are model/reporting layers only; they never invent field values. Live runtime, CLI, backend, and UI integration of the diagnosis, routing, and finalization gate remain open (Phases 11 and 12). No OCR or document-ingestion behavior is implemented in this version; Phase 4B is roadmap documentation only.

